# CLAUDE.md is committed in this repo, overriding the global ignore: it is the one-line import of
# AGENTS.md, which carries the project capability table that skills branch on. Without the shim
# Claude Code never loads that table, and a declaration not loaded reads as "not enabled" — a silent
# skipped check. Personal, uncommitted instructions go in CLAUDE.local.md instead.
!CLAUDE.md
